    "message": "[ipa-delivery:662] build(delivery): request the common private IPA 662 (RPCS3 Core 660, MeloNX Core 661, host test page and left stick, 9403a7bf, PR #162)\n\nFrozen at the draft commit (standard_delivery.py freeze 662: no blocker,\neffective digest 446df466...). Base: the delivered and verified 658 (run\n41955134733, IPA 89607f58). Replaced: RPCS3 Core 660 (pin f4c82c38, run\n41995875495, payload 367a24cc...) and MeloNX Core 661 (run 42013433386,\npackaged 0e6d5eb8...). Kept: Dolphin, ARMSX2, libretro, MeloNX dependencies.\nPromoted: 9403a7bf. Tests: flutter and native fresh, delivery contract\n(local: contract test OK, contract 662 offline OK). trigger-paths: accepted\n(standard-delivery jobs only). First Swift compile of the MeloNX left-stick\nhost files. No physical device run yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
